{"repositoryId":1293715222,"availability":"available","full":"Cristofferb7/wxd-spec-coding-dashboard","name":"wxd-spec-coding-dashboard","description":"Pulse — commerce intelligence dashboard. FastAPI backend running federated Presto/Cassandra/Iceberg queries behind one API, with a zero-dependency JS frontend and a zero-infra demo mode on Vercel.","category":"Business","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-08T14:26:52Z","updated":"2026-07-11T22:21:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://wxd-spec-coding-dashboard.vercel.app","topics":["analytics","dashboard","data-visualization","ecommerce","fastapi","federated-query","iceberg","presto","python","sql","vanilla-js"],"demo":"https://wxd-spec-coding-dashboard.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:29.090Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:29.090Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T23:49:29.090Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T23:49:29.090Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A read-only e-commerce operations dashboard built during IBM's watsonx.data shared-cloud spec-coding workshop: the API contract and requirements were written first (spec/, api/openapi.yaml), then the implementation was AI-coded against that spec and verified by an integration test suite.","The original build ran federated SQL against a live watsonx.data cluster — single Presto queries joining hot operational data in Cassandra with cold historical rollups in Iceberg. Since the workshop cluster is ephemeral, this repo also ships a demo mode that serves a deterministic generated dataset with the exact same API shapes, so the app runs anywhere (including the public Vercel deployment) with zero infrastructure."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Cristofferb7/wxd-spec-coding-dashboard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"57312d71db1ad52118b0fef92610d6df49ecf3526da97d40888b6f05fdf77440","extractedAt":"202